  m_text: "Welcome to Pondbound\nTo get more information about the game press the ESC key and go to How To Play.\n\nObjective: \n- Escape the Containment Lab and make to the next room.\n- (Online) Free the other frogs and work together to escape the lab before time runs out\n- (Online) All Players must exit together before moving to the next level. \n\nGameplay Tip:\n- You can use your tongue to move and interact with objects in the level. Use it to activate pressure plates. (Multiple frogs can also activate pressure plates if boxes or objects are not available.)"
